        "TileImage": "$($repository 335ce4e7-36bb-45cd-aa24-18564d48ed4e).Image",
        "Description": "The International Security firm CICADA has been struggling to attract bussiness after a series of incidents of theft, corporate espionage, and assassination sunk their reputation. In order to improve their security protocols, they wish to train with an actual assassin. We have provided a cover identity for you to use to inflitrate a replica of a fashion show, complete with an array of actors. &quot;Assassinate&quot; the listed VIPs CICADA protect in order to point the flaws in their security.\rGood Luck 47",
